# Line endings are LF in the repository and in the working tree.
#
# Without this, git on Windows normalises SPEC.html to CRLF on checkout while
# storing LF, and every `git add` of it prints "LF will be replaced by CRLF".
# The warning is noise, but a repository that is half-converted is not: a
# CRLF copy of schema.sql hashes differently from the LF one, and the build
# asserts dist/*.sql is byte-identical to src/*.sql.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Generated audio and databases are bytes, never text. All of these are
# gitignored as well; this is the second net, in case one ever is not.
*.mp3 binary
*.m4a binary
*.wav binary
*.ogg binary
*.opus binary
*.flac binary
*.mp4 binary
*.webm binary
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.db binary
*.sqlite binary
*.sqlite3 binary
*.mochi binary
